{"hw":"ἰδιωτεύω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἰδιωτεύω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἰδιωτ-εύω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">occupy a private station</b>, opp. <span class=\"gk\">δημοσιεύω</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">32a</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">579c</span> </span>; opp. <span class=\"gk\">ἄρχω</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hier.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.5</span> </span>; opp. <span class=\"gk\">τυραννεύω</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.4</span> </span>; opp. <span class=\"gk\">πολιτεύεσθαι</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aeschin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.195</span> </span>; of a country, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be of no consideration</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.7.7</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">practise privately</b>, of a physician, opp. <span class=\"gk\">ὁ δημοσιεύων</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Plt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">259a</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Grg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">514e</span> </span>sq. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> c. gen. rei, <span class=\"gk\">τῆς ἀρετῆς ἰ</span>. <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be unpractised, unskilled in.. </b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">327a</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">IV</span> in Lit. Crit., <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be vulgar</b>, of expressions, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Longin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">31.2</span> </span>.</div></div>"}